<title>USA: MedPartners, Caremark complete merger.</title>
<headline>MedPartners, Caremark complete merger.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedPartners/Mullikin Inc and Caremark International Inc said on Thursday that they have completed their previously announced merger.</p>
</text>
